cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MicroMap in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MicroMap (Graphomics Knowledge Graph Platform)"
abstract: >-
  A microbiome knowledge graph platform powered by Neo4j, with a
  reviewable ingestion pipeline (MapForge) that turns raw tabular and
  BioCypher-adapter-sourced data into parameterized Cypher bundles a
  reviewer can approve before any node lands in the graph. Not affiliated
  with the identically-named MicroMap microbiome-metabolism visualization
  resource (Thiele lab, npj Biofilms and Microbiomes, 2025,
  https://dataverse.harvard.edu/dataverse/micromap).
authors:
  - family-names: Khandavalli
    given-names: Varun
    affiliation: Graphomics
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/vkhangraphomics/micromap-oss"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - knowledge-graph
  - neo4j
  - biomedical
  - microbiome
  - data-ingestion
  - biocypher
